{"body": [{"author": {"avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1309177?v=4", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/charliermarsh/events{/privacy}", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/charliermarsh/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/charliermarsh/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/charliermarsh/gists{/gist_id}", "gravatar_id": "", "html_url": "https://github.com/charliermarsh", "id": 1309177, "login": "charliermarsh", "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDkxNzc=", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/charliermarsh/orgs", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/charliermarsh/received_events", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/charliermarsh/repos", "site_admin": false, "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/charliermarsh/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/charliermarsh/subscriptions", "type": "User", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/charliermarsh", "user_view_type": "public"}, "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/commits/3c1844ca4a8aa4742db27493fed4f5a421bd59ff/comments", "commit": {"author": {"date": "2025-08-06T23:01:55Z", "email": "charlie.r.marsh@gmail.com", "name": "Charlie Marsh"}, "comment_count": 0, "committer": {"date": "2025-08-06T23:01:55Z", "email": "noreply@github.com", "name": "GitHub"}, "message": "Add support for per-project build-time environment variables (#15095)\n\n## Summary\n\nE.g., you can now do:\n\n```toml\n[tool.uv.extra-build-variables]\nflash-attn = { FLASH_ATTENTION_SKIP_CUDA_BUILD = \"TRUE\" }\n```", "tree": {"sha": "592ea3ef671d6fff83a12a292ad996ad3c305aee", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/git/trees/592ea3ef671d6fff83a12a292ad996ad3c305aee"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/git/commits/3c1844ca4a8aa4742db27493fed4f5a421bd59ff", "verification": {"payload": "tree 592ea3ef671d6fff83a12a292ad996ad3c305aee\nparent fb518380ab2