ITB40IJaBg/g0H/qFaeH/l3\n02yB+YcpodwEC965/PYI\n=eQZK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "verified": true, "verified_at": "2025-08-05T19:17:12Z"}}, "committer": {"avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}", "gravatar_id": "", "html_url": "https://github.com/web-flow", "id": 19864447, "login": "web-flow", "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos", "site_admin": false, "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions", "type": "User", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow", "user_view_type": "public"}, "html_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/commit/3f83390e342dcb6fccc449335c15d1255885ad20", "node_id": "C_kwDOKbIFZdoAKDNmODMzOTBlMzQyZGNiNmZjY2M0NDkzMzVjMTVkMTI1NTg4NWFkMjA", "parents": [{"html_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/commit/57f900ad0d1c69dfb25cf31d83a7cedbd928608d", "sha": "57f900ad0d1c69dfb25cf31d83a7cedbd928608d", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/commits/57f900ad0d1c69dfb25cf31d83a7cedbd928608d"}], "sha": "3f83390e342dcb6fccc449335c15d1255885ad20", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/commits/3f83390e342dcb6fccc449335c15d1255885ad20"}, {"author": {"avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2586601?v=4", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/events{/privacy}", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/gists{/gist_id}", "gravatar_id": "", "html_url": "https://github.com/zanieb", "id": 2586601, "login": "zanieb", "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODY2MDE=", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/orgs", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/received_events", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/repos", "site_admin": false, "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/subscriptions", "type": "User", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb", "user_view_type": "public"}, "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/commits/6856a27711910d240a488d53d7967b73340b1524/comments", "commit": {"author": {"date": "2025-07-30T14:53:07Z", "email": "contact@zanie.dev", "name": "Zanie Blue"}, "comment_count": 0, "committer": {"date": "2025-07-30T14:53:07Z", "email": "noreply@github.com", "name": "GitHub"}, "message": "Add `extra-build-dependencies` (#14735)\n\nReplaces https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/14092\n\nAdds `tool.uv.extra-build-dependencies = {package = [dependency, ...]}`\nwhich extends `build-system.requires` during package builds.\n\nThese are lowered via workspace sources, are applied to transitive\ndependencies, and are included in the wheel cache shard hash.\n\nThere are some features we need to follow-up on, but are out of scope\nhere:\n\n- Preferring locked versions for build dependencies\n- Settings for requiring locked versions for build depencies\n\nThere are some quality of life follow-ups we should also do:\n\n- Warn on `extra-build-dependencies` that do not apply to any packages\n- Add test cases and improve error messaging when the\n`extra-build-dependencies` resolve fails\n\n\n-------\n\nThere ~are~ were a few open decisions to be made here\n\n1. Should we resolve these dependencies alongside the\n`build-system.requires` dependencies? Or should we resolve separately?\n(I think the latter is more powerful? because you can override things?\nbut it opens the door to breaking your build)\n2. Should we install these dependencies into the same environment? Or\nshould we layer it on top as we do elsewhere? (I think it's fine to\ninstall into the same environment)\n3. Should we respect sources defined in the parent project? (I think\nyes, but then we need to lower the dependencies earlier \u2014 I don't think\nthat's a big deal, but it's not implemented)\n4. Should we respect sources defined in the child project? (I think no,\nthis gets really complicated and seems weird to allow)\n5. Should we apply this to transitive dependencies? (I think so)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Aria Desires <aria.desires@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: konstin <konstin@mailbox.org>", "tree": {"sha": "e72b3103d76b75582d4be968b08201699a7b212e", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/git/trees/e72b3103d76b75582d4be968b08201699a7b212e"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/git/commits/6856a27711910d240a488d53d7967b73340b1524", "verification": {"payload": "tree e72b3103d76b75582d4be968b08201699a7b212e\nparent 17f0c91896d43b66851229d26385a6989d9e71b2\nauthor Zanie Blue <contact@zanie.dev> 1753887187 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1753887187 -0500\n\nAdd `extra-build-dependencies` (#14735)\n\nReplaces https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/14092\n\nAdds `tool.uv.extra-build-dependencies = {package = [dependency, ...]}`\nwhich extends `build-system.requires` during package builds.\n\nThese are lowered via workspace sources, are applied to transitive\ndependencies, and are included in the wheel cache shard hash.\n\nThere are some features we need to follow-up on, but are out of scope\nhere:\n\n- Preferring locked versions for build dependencies\n- Settings for requiring locked versions for build depencies\n\nThere are some quality of life follow-ups we should also do:\n\n- Warn on `extra-build-dependencies` that do not apply to any packages\n- Add test cases and improve error messaging when the\n`extra-build-dependencies` resolve fails\n\n\n-------\n\nThere ~are~ were a few open decisions to be made here\n\n1. Should we resolve these dependencies alongside the\n`build-system.requires` dependencies? Or should we resolve separately?\n(I think the latter is more powerful? because you can override things?\nbut it opens the door to breaking your build)\n2. Should we install these dependencies into the same environment? Or\nshould we layer it on top as we do elsewhere? (I think it's fine to\ninstall into the same environment)\n3. Should we respect sources defined in the parent project? (I think\nyes, but then we need to lower the dependencies earlier \u2014 I don't think\nthat's a big deal, but it's not implemented)\n4. Should we respect sources defined in the child project? (I think no,\nthis gets really complicated and seems weird to allow)\n5. Should we apply this to transitive dependencies? (I think so)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Aria Desires <aria.desires@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: konstin <konstin@mailbox.org>", "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoijHTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjl0QAF1OO8grMu33IZDpo2RrIVss\nMvUlRtipskSdl8XlQ6z8kU4tjgOrBvflhMtUSq1G5yhO/R4MEhkbxj4aybzuFClh\nWGW6G+JzB6XNCPLRVhOg68Msv/OmqynhHyp2xmFSNcU8VSPpZuxKoMOOWcmMP0Mr\nKpn1LAGuVKrF5NDacuB5mroDz8MMtYCRafLKgI/MVGKCQYGieS31Wlei/Eaeipsa\nkTOmzdP3q4cFYmtXt2tqdHUI9yrpTz2+4wmUMHeeevr8Dy1pjS056Xd7ANXE/ggv\nmqwyP3EO3v+IP5AE9njmW4chem2NDvA9j9SMmS4B42n70pgGuCIiXZMNGWzE7ElG\ngDE066iHrPBOpN3OWXNIFJsCd7I0wkIl7VrsIPUF35hUlASlU4cTImsiqFwFyGrW\npnaWaOCkHitpc4bnVt7R4hVRMx5T/jXnZJ/k9FIKOU7+TKcQs+arIzrwl/mUEd7B\n83jM+DE71uqSUbBUVAN4vmrUxUCGwxN6E0SfXNJFZV2/5x0V9V1fkT8qCUi0Zcli\ntJskE60bINWLecjml9JZS6ukPjjQM3qHSGopidb0oH8wjCodutY302dnSEZuiQhI\nCa7KUNvmIcfOD1f/Mn7ZfKJliR/BsF4/hxy2RjAwFBvZUeUEiS+Lu6FuPXRASYtn\nNAshQcSRATwANKftgSUW\n=JJnR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "verified": true, "verified_at": "2025-07-30T14:53:08Z"}}, "committer": {"avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}", "gravatar_id": "", "html_url": "https://github.com/web-flow", "id": 19864447, "login": "web-flow", "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos", "site_admin": false, "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions", "type": "User", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow", "user_view_type": "public"}, "html_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/commit/6856a27711910d240a488d53d7967b73340b1524", "node_id": "C_kwDOKbIFZdoAKDY4NTZhMjc3MTE5MTBkMjQwYTQ4OGQ1M2Q3OTY3YjczMzQwYjE1MjQ", "parents": [{"html_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/commit/17f0c91896d43b66851229d26385a6989d9e71b2", "sha": "17f0c91896d43b66851229d26385a6989d9e71b2", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/commits/17f0c91896d43b66851229d26385a6989d9e71b2"}], "sha": "6856a27711910d240a488d53d7967b73340b1524", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/commits/6856a27711910d240a488d53d7967b73340b1524"}, {"author": {"avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2586601?v=4", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/events{/privacy}", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/gists{/gist_id}", "gravatar_id": "", "html_url": "https://github.com/zanieb", "id": 2586601, "login": "zanieb", "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODY2MDE=", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/orgs", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/received_events", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/repos", "site_admin": false, "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/subscriptions", "type": "User", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb", "user_view_type": "public"}, "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/commits/cd40a3452295a8d4b6af69206c43282096507c89/comments", "commit": {"author": {"date": "2025-07-17T18:38:02Z", "email": "contact@zanie.dev", "name": "Zanie Blue"}, "comment_count": 0, "committer": {"date": "2025-07-17T22:20:21Z", "email": "contact@zanie.dev", "name": "Zanie Blue"}, "message": "Build and install workspace members that are dependencies by default (#14663)\n\nRegardless of the presence of a build system, as in\nhttps://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/14413\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: John Mumm <jtfmumm@gmail.com>", "tree": {"sha": "4f5a72cdf4900756b9512ecb79d4cf6fe8cb9a8a", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/git/trees/4f5a72cdf4900756b9512ecb79d4cf6fe8cb9a8a"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/git/commits/cd40a3452295a8d4b6af69206c43282096507c89", "verification": {"payload": null, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "verified": false, "verified_at": null}}, "committer": {"avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2586601?v=4", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/events{/privacy}", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/gists{/gist_id}", "gravatar_id": "", "html_url": "https://github.com/zanieb", "id": 2586601, "login": "zanieb", "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODY2MDE=", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/orgs", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/received_events", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/repos", "site_admin": false, "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/subscriptions", "type": "User", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb", "user_view_type": "public"}, "html_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/commit/cd40a3452295a8d4b6af69206c43282096507c89", "node_id": "C_kwDOKbIFZdoAKGNkNDBhMzQ1MjI5NWE4ZDRiNmFmNjkyMDZjNDMyODIwOTY1MDdjODk", "parents": [{"html_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/commit/0077f2357f4e016c871b2b651ca59a139a95f19a", "sha": "0077f2357f4e016c871b2b651ca59a139a95f19a", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/commits/0077f2357f4e016c871b2b651ca59a139a95f19a"}], "sha": "cd40a3452295a8d4b6af69206c43282096507c89", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/commits/cd40a3452295a8d4b6af69206c43282096507c89"}, {"author": {"avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1309177?v=4", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/charliermarsh/events{/privacy}", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/charliermarsh/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/charliermarsh/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/charliermarsh/gists{/gist_id}", "gravatar_id": "", "html_url": "https://github.com/charliermarsh", "id": 1309177, "login": "charliermarsh", "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDkxNzc=", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/charliermarsh/orgs", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/charliermarsh/received_events", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/charliermarsh/repos", "site_admin": false, "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/charliermarsh/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/charliermarsh/subscriptions", "type": "User", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/charliermarsh", "user_view_type": "public"}, "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/commits/dff9ced40ab2633d32f7e9bcdcb6484500caf621/comments", "commit": {"author": {"date": "2025-07-11T02:20:01Z", "email": "charlie.r.marsh@gmail.com", "name": "Charlie Marsh"}, "comment_count": 0, "committer": {"date": "2025-07-17T22:20:21Z", "email": "contact@zanie.dev", "name": "Zanie Blue"}, "message": "Support conflicting editable settings across groups (#14197)\n\nIf a user specifies `-e /path/to/dir` and `/path/to/dir` in a `uv pip\ninstall` command, we want the editable to \"win\" (rather than erroring\ndue to conflicting URLs). Unfortunately, this behavior meant that when\nyou requested a package as editable and non-editable in conflicting\ngroups, the editable version was _always_ used. This PR modifies the\nrequisite types to use `Option<bool>` rather than `bool` for the\n`editable` field, so we can determine whether a requirement was\nexplicitly requested as editable, explicitly requested as non-editable,\nor not specified (as in the case of `/path/to/dir` in a\n`requirements.txt` file). In the latter case, we allow editables to\noverride the \"unspecified\" requirement.\n\nIf a project includes a path dependency twice, once with `editable =\ntrue` and once without any `editable` annotation, those are now\nconsidered conflicting URLs, and lead to an error, so I've marked this\nchange as breaking.\n\nCloses https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/issues/14139.", "tree": {"sha": "e1328a0c52325e2f10c9d22927450208d639bb21", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/git/trees/e1328a0c52325e2f10c9d22927450208d639bb21"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/git/commits/dff9ced40ab2633d32f7e9bcdcb6484500caf621", "verification": {"payload": null, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "verified": false, "verified_at": null}}, "committer": {"avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2586601?v=4", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/events{/privacy}", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/gists{/gist_id}", "gravatar_id": "", "html_url": "https://github.com/zanieb", "id": 2586601, "login": "zanieb", "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODY2MDE=", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/orgs", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/received_events", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/repos", "site_admin": false, "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/subscriptions", "type": "User", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb", "user_view_type": "public"}, "html_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/commit/dff9ced40ab2633d32f7e9bcdcb6484500caf621", "node_id": "C_kwDOKbIFZdoAKGRmZjljZWQ0MGFiMjYzM2QzMmY3ZTliY2RjYjY0ODQ1MDBjYWY2MjE", "parents": [{"html_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/commit/c3d7d3899c435d528d34f242a3750aeed1bb8c50", "sha": "c3d7d3899c435d528d34f242a3750aeed1bb8c50", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/commits/c3d7d3899c435d528d34f242a3750aeed1bb8c50"}], "sha": "dff9ced40ab2633d32f7e9bcdcb6484500caf621", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/commits/dff9ced40ab2633d32f7e9bcdcb6484500caf621"}, {"author": {"avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1136864?v=4", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Gankra/events{/privacy}", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Gankra/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Gankra/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Gankra/gists{/gist_id}", "gravatar_id": "", "html_url": "https://github.com/Gankra", "id": 1136864, "login": "Gankra", "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjExMzY4NjQ=", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Gankra/orgs", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Gankra/received_events", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Gankra/repos", "site_admin": false, "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Gankra/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Gankra/subscriptions", "type": "User", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Gankra", "user_view_type": "public"}, "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/commits/ff9c2c35d7bb35670115571f6b2e6e3213ed1d27/comments", "commit": {"author": {"date": "2025-06-13T22:16:48Z", "email": "aria.desires@gmail.com", "name": "Aria Desires"}, "comment_count": 0, "committer": {"date": "2025-06-13T22:16:48Z", "email": "noreply@github.com", "name": "GitHub"}, "message": "Support reading dependency-groups from pyproject.tomls with no project (#13742)\n\n(or legacy tool.uv.workspace).\n\nThis cleaves out a dedicated SourcedDependencyGroups type based on\nRequiresDist but with only the DependencyGroup handling implemented.\nThis allows `uv pip` to read `dependency-groups` from pyproject.tomls\nthat only have that table defined, per PEP 735, and as implemented by\n`pip`.\n\nHowever we want our implementation to respect various uv features when\nthey're available:\n\n* `tool.uv.sources`\n* `tool.uv.index`\n* `tool.uv.dependency-groups.mygroup.requires-python` (#13735)\n\nAs such we want to opportunistically detect \"as much as possible\" while\ndoing as little as possible when things are missing. The issue with the\nold RequiresDist path was that it fundamentally wanted to build the\npackage, and if `[project]` was missing it would try to desperately run\nsetuptools on the pyproject.toml to try to find metadata and make a hash\nof things.\n\nAt the same time, the old code also put in a lot of effort to try to\npretend that `uv pip` dependency-groups worked like `uv`\ndependency-groups with defaults and non-only semantics, only to separate\nthem back out again. By explicitly separating them out, we confidently\nget the expected behaviour.\n\nNote that dependency-group support is still included in RequiresDist, as\nsome `uv` paths still use it. It's unclear to me if those paths want\nthis same treatment -- for now I conclude no.\n\nFixes #13138", "tree": {"sha": "63d7b5ec66fbad3d7aac41c0f51e6c86ba38282c", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/git/trees/63d7b5ec66fbad3d7aac41c0f51e6c86ba38282c"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/git/commits/ff9c2c35d7bb35670115571f6b2e6e3213ed1d27", "verification": {"payload": "tree 63d7b5ec66fbad3d7aac41c0f51e6c86ba38282c\nparent 50218409191c55587e832e649699ef5d07a611e8\nauthor Aria Desires <aria.desires@gmail.com> 1749853008 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1749853008 +0000\n\nSupport reading dependency-groups from pyproject.tomls with no project (#13742)\n\n(or legacy tool.uv.workspace).\n\nThis cleaves out a dedicated SourcedDependencyGroups type based on\nRequiresDist but with only the DependencyGroup handling implemented.\nThis allows `uv pip` to read `dependency-groups` from pyproject.tomls\nthat only have that table defined, per PEP 735, and as implemented by\n`pip`.\n\nHowever we want our implementation to respect various uv features when\nthey're available:\n\n* `tool.uv.sources`\n* `tool.uv.index`\n* `tool.uv.dependency-groups.mygroup.requires-python` (#13735)\n\nAs such we want to opportunistically detect \"as much as possible\" while\ndoing as little as possible when things are missing. The issue with the\nold RequiresDist path was that it fundamentally wanted to build the\npackage, and if `[project]` was missing it would try to desperately run\nsetuptools on the pyproject.toml to try to find metadata and make a hash\nof things.\n\nAt the same time, the old code also put in a lot of effort to try to\npretend that `uv pip` dependency-groups worked like `uv`\ndependency-groups with defaults and non-only semantics, only to separate\nthem back out again. By explicitly separating them out, we confidently\nget the expected behaviour.\n\nNote that dependency-group support is still included in RequiresDist, as\nsome `uv` paths still use it. It's unclear to me if those paths want\nthis same treatment -- for now I conclude no.\n\nFixes #13138", "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoTKNQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4WEQADEaLhRdq+3W2UHIODyjMNw/\nqVn9A7+9gcA98BVt/oq3LQ+odtcjy6xDuuzXJ2GSbX86sHjC3+gN/rmSB4O2rYnE\nZ2H1jA0FVIg+cZJs+bwIxd2cabTlJp2TGGvx3TvK7wlKkHe6bJzGAu6EhDCQ0BjW\nUwBalMu7SGd8X1TLIiPaM3i7ojd2F/BOb2vloTcVfeHAFlboBRyO5gMvNQ9cIYNh\n9rVKXd5V6cGOE9kPx5X//Mb+c4mti4Q8D3BsnmCdXsP+BU1dshkddXXym8GrnnUd\n5swdql8Gqlhj9TxL/KvGpNBFPkmdbs8qD2JZ0vk1hWzd4XR+8W7FBiotBwUL+VVA\nN7gMHg9XKFySOThqbulJwlhT3FQcdiBJpkvhPyW6WR+IfjaQRykr70YsCDo3/1TF\nWTdGWtXR/n3r6+CXNm9L1hspCYWMdrDEU/20sNz7yp4zGMj8nd1+9jaLGblx/ha8\naGMdB0esYEMeb/wVmAnmkhQ3KmUX5HiHzRnLW5FI2GuKpboBrZWaUYm/VnStWUmZ\nXiOSTYHDQfEbyOEcmcw3epKSCtDqVR7EdQqzW3JA/24+rcijnbtaGVIFl85/bwPS\n95lFwUIc/BDk/zR6tZFNpNBHdsTB21CD/7oxxnNc5eA5E5IP9yBb8aLtGVMjSII5\nWAg87Y0I5ZTLDeYXKmj5\n=HMr+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "verified": true, "verified_at": "2025-06-13T22:16:52Z"}}, "committer": {"avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}", "gravatar_id": "", "html_url": "https://github.com/web-flow", "id": 19864447, "login": "web-flow", "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flo